%description:
Tests adaptiveDelayedAcks=true, the pingpong mode of Linux. The server replies
to the data of t=1.0 within the ATO (40 ms) of its arrival, so the connection
is interactive (tcp_event_data_sent()). The server then delays the ACK of the
data of t=2.0 by the ATO, 40 ms, although it has a quickack budget. The
expiry of that delayed ACK ends the pingpong mode (tcp_delack_timer_handler()),
so the data of t=3.0 gets its ACK at once.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 100; 2.0 100; 3.0 100"
*.srv_app.sendScript="1.01 100"
*.srv_tcp.adaptiveDelayedAcks = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:101(100) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.003 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 101 win 16384 
[1.011 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A 501:601(100) ack 101 win 16384 
[1.213 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 601 win 16384 
[2.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 101:201(100) ack 601 win 16384 
[2.043 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 201 win 16384 
[3.001 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A 201:301(100) ack 601 win 16384 
[3.003 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 301 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
scheduling the adaptive delayed ACK (ATO 0.04)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
